{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "22abcd09-5ff2-81da-8812-dc7c19dacf0d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T12:28:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. I am calling about a fence. I want to ask some questions before I sign something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'd be glad to help. I'm sorry, you're coming through very quietly. Could you say that again a little louder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry. My phone volume is very low and I cannot fix it. Is this better? I got a quote from a fence company, and before I sign, I want to know the rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little better, thank you. So you're looking at putting up a fence. What kind, and how tall are you thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is composite, not wood. Six feet tall. On the other hand, the company said they handle everything, but I do not know what everything means."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And where's the property? Is it your own home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am the homeowner. It is 362 Memorial Boulevard, on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 362 Memorial Boulevard. So generally, yes, a fence in the city does usually need a permit, and height is one of the things we look at. Six feet is on the taller side, so I'd expect paperwork for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the answer is yes, I need a permit? On the other hand, the company said maybe only if it is more than a certain height. I did not understand that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can see why that's confusing. Height can matter, and so can where it sits on your lot. I can't tell you your exact situation without looking at your property. But for a six-foot fence, plan on needing a permit. Who's doing the application, you or the company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am not sure. Is it me or the company? On the other hand, I am the owner, so maybe it is me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can work. Contractors often file on the owner's behalf, but you'd want that in writing in your quote. Ask them straight out whether the permit is included in the price."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will ask this. And one more thing. Must I tell my neighbor? Like a notice, a letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, could you repeat that? You cut out a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. The neighbor. Do I need to notify the neighbor before the fence goes up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Whether a notice is required isn't something I can say for sure from here. I'd suggest talking to your neighbor anyway, especially about where the line is. Let me have an inspector call you back about the notice part and the lot details. Is the number you're calling from the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six four, got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maria Souza. S-O-U-Z-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Maria. So to recap: expect a permit for a six-foot composite fence, confirm in writing who files it, and someone will call you about the neighbor question. Please hold off signing until you hear back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will wait. On the other hand, I still do not fully understand the height part, but maybe the inspector can explain it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They will. Happy New Year's Eve, Maria."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, to you also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
